              </p>

              <p className="text-[11px] text-zinc-500">
                Private IP space
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>

          <p className="mt-4 text-xs leading-5 text-zinc-500">
            These are systems observed inside the private network,
            such as workstations, servers, or other internal hosts.
